# Top items export & section comments

Read `apps/web/AGENTS.md` for the full web agent notes.

## Section comment headers

Label distinct UI regions with short JSX comments (same style as `CompactRankListCard`):

```tsx
{/* Rank */}
{/* Image */}
{/* Content */}
{/* Stats */}
```

Apply this in cards, item cards, and export layouts when adding or editing markup.

## Export layouts

- Use `TopItemsExportGrid` / `TopItemsExportList` for grid/list capture — not the on-screen list/grid.
- Keep grid export images square (`aspect-square`).
- Limit list export to 10 items; grid export to 12 items (3 columns × 4 rows).
- Export typography should stay large enough to read on the 1080×1920 portrait canvas.
- Reuse `src/components/export` helpers (`useOffscreenExport`, `html2canvas-pro`); do not reintroduce `html2canvas` (oklch unsupported).
